    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "",
      "className": "container",
      "title": "",
      "contentSnippet": "Facilities Manager, Dubai Residential Tower\n\"QuantaSec’s team was highly professional from day one. Their CCTV and access control installation was seamless, and their AMC support keeps everything running flawlessly.\"\nOperations Head, Retail Mall Group\n\"We needed a SIRA-compliant upgrade across multiple malls. QuantaSec delivered ahead of schedule with zero downtime. Their expertise in ELV systems is unmatched.\"\nIT Director, Commercial Complex\n\"Their centralized monitoring system helped us unify all building security under one dashboard. It’s efficient, smart, and exactly what we needed.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "",
      "className": "container",
      "title": "",
      "contentSnippet": "We install CCTV, access control, gate barrier, intercom, and structured cabling systems, all tailored to meet SIRA and UAE regulations.\nYes, we provide annual maintenance contracts (AMC), preventive servicing, and retrofitting of existing systems with the latest technologies.\nAbsolutely. Our solutions are scalable and suitable for residential towers, commercial spaces, owner associations, and large-scale community developments."
    },
